---
import ContactFormAdvanced from '@/components/ContactFormAdvanced.astro';
import InteriorLayout from '@/layouts/InteriorLayout.astro';
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '@/config';
import { telegramQuoteLink } from '@/lib/quote-policy';
---
<InteriorLayout title="Start a conversation — Hodges & Co. Studios" description="Tell Hodges & Co. Studios what you want to build. Custom software, guided builds with AI coding tools, and trading technology. Based in Accra, working globally.">
  <main id="main">
    <section class="interior-mast"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Contact / A good place to begin</p><h1>Big ambition.<br /><em>One conversation.</em></h1><p class="lede">A rough idea is enough. Tell us what you’re trying to make possible, and we’ll work out a sensible next step together.</p><div class="mast-foot"><span>Build it for me / Build it with me</span><span>Accra, Ghana · Working globally</span></div></div></section>
    <section class="wrap section-space contact-spread"><aside class="contact-aside"><p class="eyebrow">Let’s make something useful</p><h2>The first step<br />is a little context.</h2><p>Who is it for? What should it change? What have you tried? Share what you know — we can help with the rest.</p><a class="contact-email" href={`mailto:${SITE_CONFIG.email}`}>{SITE_CONFIG.email}</a><p><a class="button" href={telegramQuoteLink()} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discuss your project on Telegram ↗</a></p><div class="contact-notes"><div><span>Based in</span><strong>Accra, Ghana · GMT</strong></div><div><span>Prefer to explore first?</span><a href="/estimate-project">Project estimator ↗</a></div><div><span>Want to talk it through?</span><a href="/booking">Arrange a consultation ↗</a></div></div></aside>
    <div class="advanced-enquiry"><ContactFormAdvanced /></div></section>
    <section class="wrap section-space faq-section-premium editorial-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">A few useful answers</p><h2>Before we begin.</h2></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>Do I need a finished brief?</summary><p>No. A description of the problem and who it affects is a useful starting point. We can help define the scope before committing to a build.</p></details><details><summary>Can you help me build it myself?</summary><p>Yes. Guided builds cover planning, coding, debugging, review, and deployment with tools such as Codex and Claude Code. We agree the level of support around your experience and goals.</p></details><details><summary>Can you work on an existing project?</summary><p>Yes. Share the current product, the issue, and your intended outcome. We’ll review the work before recommending a practical approach.</p></details><details><summary>How are scope and payment agreed?</summary><p>We agree deliverables, milestones, responsibilities, price, and payment terms in a proposal before work starts. The estimator prepares your project brief. We review it with you on Telegram before providing an actual estimate.</p></details></div></section>
  </main>
</InteriorLayout>
